# App Name

A brief description of the mobile application and its purpose.

# Features Highlight
1. Picker
Users answer three questions by identifying different milk tea brands.
The Picker component allows users to select their answers from a dropdown list.

2. TouchableOpacity
Each question displays an image of a milk tea brand.
Users can tap the image to reveal a hint using Alert.alert().

3. Answer Checking (Conditional Statements)
The app uses if statements to check whether the selected answers are correct.
Each correct answer adds one point to the total score.

4. Alert
Users can click the Submit Answer button after completing the quiz.
An alert displays the number of correct answers out of three.

5. useState
The useState hook stores the answers selected by users.
The app updates the selected answers whenever users choose a different option.

6. ScrollView
The ScrollView component allows users to scroll through all three questions and images.

